% Typical deep learning models, while powerful, could struggle to disentangle the intricate soundscapes, often treating all incoming audio information with equal weight. This is where attention-based architectures, spearheaded by the revolutionary Transformer models, offer a profound leap forward in Sound Source Localization (SSL).
