\subsection{Investigated Models}

We investigate three open-source LALMs: DeSTA2~\cite{desta2}, Qwen-Audio-Chat (Qwen)\cite{qwen}, and Qwen2-Audio-Instruct (Qwen2)\cite{qwen2}. These models are selected for their strong performance on the attribute recognition tracks of SAKURA~\cite{sakura}, from which we source our dataset. Additionally, they perform competitively on other speech and audio benchmarks~\cite{airbench, mmau}, making them well-suited for our analyses. We implement Logit Lens on these models using the Patchscopes toolkit~\cite{patchscopes}.

