\subsection{Baseline Comparison}
\label{sec:results_baseline}
This section compares the baseline performance of the cascaded, partial-cascaded  and end-to-end SGEC systems. All models are trained on the manually annotated LNG$_\text{lbl}$ training set and evaluated on both the in-domain LNG$_\text{lbl}$ test set (referred to as LNG) and the out-of-domain S\&I Dev set. To assess the effect of model capacity, two variants of Whisper models are evaluated, namely \texttt{small.en} and \texttt{large-v2}. Detailed training and configuration setups for each system are described in Section~\ref{sec:exp_setup}. 

