 $p_{\text{ps}}$, $p_{\text{sw}}$, and $p_{\text{ant}}$ are typically on the order of $100 \$$, $0.1 \$$, and $0.01 \$$, respectively, it is not difficult to prove that the proposed RAA can reduce the hardware cost, i.e., $\text{cost}_{\text{RAA}}< \text{cost}_{\text{HBF}}$.
