Let $M$ be a \tdfa[2]  with a supersafe head $H_1$ and another head $H_2$, recognizing language $\langL$.  In relation to $M$ and $H_1$, let $N_1$ be the corresponding \tdfa{} described in \Cref{def:supersafe}.


