        \titem{Run the ``proof'' algorithm specified in \Cref{fig:honestprover} (codified to treat only the $x$ segment on the tape as its input string) using the \tdfa{} associated with the supersafe head of the  machine $M$ (or, identically, $M'$) described in the text.} 
