\noindent \textbf{Spatial annotations:} The IDD-PeD dataset provides bounding boxes for pedestrians and relevant traffic objects like vehicles, traffic signals, bus stations, and crosswalks, which influence pedestrian movement~\cite{vasudevan2020pedestrian,zhang2023analysis}. It includes $205,145$ annotated frames, with $494,854$ pedestrian boxes and $190,395$ boxes for other traffic objects. All bounding boxes contain occlusion information (see Fig.~\ref{fig:datastats}(e)).

