% and let $C_1 = \{x \in \Zbb \mid x_0 \equiv 0 \mod \Dlcm\}$. Then we have $S \cap H_1 \ne \varnothing \iff S \cap C_1 \ne
% \varnothing$. Note that $S \cap C_1$ is a VBF SDBM.
